 "description": "The Forcepoint Java Crypto Module is a standards-based \"Drop-in Compliance\" cryptographic engine for native Java environments. The module delivers core cryptographic functions to mobile and server platforms and features robust algorithm support, including Suite B algorithms. The Forcepoint Java Crypto Module offloads secure key management, data integrity, data at rest encryption, and secure communications to a trusted implementation.",
